  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 0.181,
      "end": 3.274,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "今年呢户外健身活动的人是越来越多了不？",
      "score": 0.3687,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2347,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2367,
        "sc_delta": -0.0019,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.709,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "今年呢，户外健身活动的人是越来越多了，不？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 3.67,
      "end": 6.859,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "但是啊，比如讲扭伤啊等等这一些呢，",
      "score": 0.3967,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1387,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1154,
        "sc_delta": 0.0233,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.336,
        "seg_cer": 0.267,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.667,
        "phon_examples": "伤/桑 扭/柳",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "但是啊，比如讲柳桑啊等等这一些，类似。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 6.859,
      "end": 9.352,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这个跌打损伤也是随之增加。",
      "score": 0.16,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0071,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0085,
        "sc_delta": -0.0013,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.5,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这个电大身上也是配置增加。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 9.545,
      "end": 13.994,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "好多人啊，就会扭伤了以后，哎马上买一瓶红花油来搓一搓。",
      "score": 0.0762,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0085,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0079,
        "sc_delta": 0.0006,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.167,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "很多人啊，就会扭上以后，哎，马上买一瓶红发油来搓一搓。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 14.203,
      "end": 17.995,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "但是总是嘛，这个伤到的地方搓了红花油以后，",
      "score": 0.1444,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0067,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0064,
        "sc_delta": 0.0003,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.316,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "但是，周师傅这个上刀的地方搓了红发油以后。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 17.995,
      "end": 21.98,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "会更加肿呢。今天我们就来为大家解答，",
      "score": 0.3264,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1855,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1892,
        "sc_delta": -0.0037,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.518,
        "seg_cer": 0.125,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "会更加重呢。嗯，今天我们就来为大家解答。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 21.98,
      "end": 25.737,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "而且教一教你如何正确使用。",
      "score": 0.6724,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.6273,
        "sc_logprob": -0.5415,
        "sc_delta": 0.0858,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.333,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "而且交易，交易如何正确使用？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 26.345,
      "end": 29.412,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "红花油是传统的中医外用药，",
      "score": 0.042,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.073,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0704,
        "sc_delta": 0.0026,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.081,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "红花油是传统的中医外用药。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 29.412,
      "end": 31.589,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "红棕色清澈的液体，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0499,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0677,
        "sc_delta": -0.0178,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "红棕色清澈的液体。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 31.589,
      "end": 35.658,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "气味呢比较独特，比较辣，用于祛风外用药，",
      "score": 0.7427,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.3846,
        "sc_logprob": -0.3732,
        "sc_delta": 0.0114,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.706,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.091,
        "phon_examples": "风/分",
        "lexicon": "咧",
        "text_free": "气味咧，不要独特，不要辣，容易区分，外容易哦。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 35.658,
      "end": 39.48,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "具有活血化瘀的作用，用于风湿骨痛、",
      "score": 0.1375,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0901,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0792,
        "sc_delta": 0.0109,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.147,
        "seg_cer": 0.133,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "具有和血发瘀的作用，用于风湿骨痛。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 39.48,
      "end": 44.095,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "跌打扭伤等症状。那有的患者扭伤之后涂了红花油，",
      "score": 0.0653,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0508,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0686,
        "sc_delta": -0.0179,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "跌打扭伤热症状，那有的患者扭伤之后吐了红发油。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 44.115,
      "end": 46.805,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "伤口呢反而更肿了，这是为什么呢？",
      "score": 0.0717,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0554,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0457,
        "sc_delta": 0.0096,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.012,
        "seg_cer": 0.143,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "伤口呢，反而更重啊！这是为什么呢？"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "start": 47.721,
      "end": 51.544,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "这里不是红花油的错，是用的时机不对造成的。",
      "score": 0.0241,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0011,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0013,
        "sc_delta": -0.0002,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.053,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "这里不是红发油的错，是用的时机不对造成的。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 15,
      "start": 51.726,
      "end": 55.299,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "在扭伤的急性期啊，也就是受伤的二十四小时之内，",
      "score": 0.0,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0006,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0006,
        "sc_delta": -0.0,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.0,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "在扭伤的急性期啊，也就是受伤的二十四小时之内。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 16,
      "start": 55.299,
      "end": 58.186,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "软组织破裂的小血管呢还没有闭合，",
      "score": 0.5505,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.9434,
        "sc_logprob": -0.8186,
        "sc_delta": 0.1247,
        "acoustic_dev": 1.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.067,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "远组织破裂的小血管呢，还没有闭合。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 17,
      "start": 58.225,
      "end": 61.897,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "还有出血的倾向。这个时候呢，应该拿冰个冰它，",
      "score": 0.0241,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0372,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0336,
        "sc_delta": 0.0037,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.053,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "还有出血的倾向。这个时候呢，应该拿冰克冰它。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 18,
      "start": 61.897,
      "end": 65.165,
      "label": "guilin",
      "text": "给它血管收缩，减少出血和渗出，",
      "score": 0.0352,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.0504,
        "sc_logprob": -0.0445,
        "sc_delta": 0.0059,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.0,
        "seg_cer": 0.077,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "给那血管收缩，减少出血和渗出。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 65.165,
      "end": 69.803,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "以减轻水肿。如果这个时候你就拿红花油这活血化瘀的药来擦呢，",
      "score": 0.5153,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.2319,
        "sc_logprob": -0.2374,
        "sc_delta": -0.0055,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.698,
